2yr yield is 4.34%... EFFR is 3.62%. 

That's a 72bps spread... the historical average is 37bps... suggesting 1-2 Fed hikes in the near term. 
@yardeni

@dailychartbook

The market-implied chance of a rate hike is 90% this year. But that's a deterministic indicator on a probabilistic measure... in reality, there's a 70% chance of a hike, and a significant chance of more than 1 hike. 
